'' pcre2-residue.ti -- what pcre2_8.ti could not carry, written by hand. Against PCRE2 10.49's
'' pcre2.h, flattened by flatten.py into the pcre2_8.h that pcre2_8.ti's banner names by SHA-256.
''
'' One TODO: PCRE2_DATE, which pcre2.h defines as bare tokens -- 2026-09-28 -- that C only ever
'' stringizes. Here it is the string. The release itself is PCRE2_MAJOR and PCRE2_MINOR, or at
'' run time pcre2_config( PCRE2_CONFIG_VERSION, buffer ).
''
'' pcre2_8.ti's three NOTEs are values c2t took from Clang rather than from the expression:
'' PCRE2_SIZE_MAX, PCRE2_ZERO_TERMINATED and PCRE2_UNSET, each ~(size_t)0. Nothing to add.
#pragma once

#define PCRE2_DATE "2026-09-28"
